{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^black and white, this Zebra is strangely wearing a gasmask inside the train. He doesn't seem to want to talk to others","\n",["ev",{"^->":"0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^•\tHi sir, I'm the train conductor, what's your name?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":"0.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^You hear is voice muffled under his gasmask. Hello, my name is Ivan Solovei. Thank you for welcoming me in your journey. ","#","^speaker:Ivan","/#","\n",{"->":"Ivan1"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["done",{"#f":5}]}],"done",{"Ivan1":[[["ev",{"^->":"Ivan1.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^you're welcome, Ivan.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Ivan1.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",[["ev",{"^->":"Ivan1.0.c-0.7.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^I have to ask, why the gasmask?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Ivan1.0.c-0.7.1.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^•\tHow are you feeling ?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Ivan1.0.c-0.7.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^He touch the mask with his hand. it feels better than without it.","\n",{"->":"Ivan1"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"Ivan1.0.c-0.7.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.1.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^I'm well, thank you.","\n","^he's clearly weaken, breathing loudly through his mask. I am on the verge of death, and I have so much regrets...","\n",{"->":"IvanBlessure"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"IvanBlessure":[[["ev",{"^->":"IvanBlessure.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","f